{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はFMヨコハマ「tre-sen」に\n若月、あみと生出演しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東のみなさん、きいたかな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は去年の5月にも出演したので、\n今回は2度目でした。\nそれでも緊張した！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"短かったけど、楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はトマト5つ食べて\n出演できたらいいな。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"*****HaPPy BirThDAy*****"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい♡2013.3.29"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいにちょっかい出すの楽しい♪\n会ったら必ずちょっかい出すんよ。\n最近みんなにいじられてる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服とか雑貨とか趣味合うのよ。\nあー一緒に買い物行きたいよ。\nまいまい！行こうね！\nかわいい雑貨屋さん行こうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だいすき"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服のスカート丈知りたい！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"折らない！膝丈！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近見た夢はどんな夢ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てもすぐ忘れちゃうよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校では化粧してる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しちゃだめなのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪さらさらでうらやましいんだけど\n髪の手入れとかって何かしてますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャンプーとリンスのみです！\n髪乾かすのめんどくさくて\nときどき自然乾燥する人です..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛いの結構好きなんだけど、\nまりっかは好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほどよく辛いものならだいすき♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういう人になりたいって\nいう理想はどんな人ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"飾らない自然体な人"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る時間って何時ごろ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"0時かなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エスニックとか好きですかー⁇\nあと、森ガール‼"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生のときエスニック森ガール\nだいすきだった。今もすきだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まりかが可愛いすぎて\nヤバいんだけどどうすればいい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？どうヤバいん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一人暮らししてみたい？\nてか家事全般できる？(笑)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大変だろうけどしてみたい。\n一人暮らしするようになったら\n自然と家事はできるようになるかな。\n今からでも家事できるように\nならなきゃだね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近料理はまってるんだけど\nこれ作れる男子かっこいいって\n料理教えてー？(^-^)/"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えー...えーと\n鯖の味噌煮！とか？\nえ？渋い？\nいや、私がすきなだけだけども"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に女の子にはこれ作れたら\n良いなーって思う料理ありますか？\nそれ練習する！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆に嫌いな食べ物知りたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"貝"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きのこ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「　BAD BOYS J　」\n楽しみにしてますヾ｡･3･｡ﾉ★.!\n万理華ちゃんは\nどんな役柄なんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！\n三上実由役です。\n真理子、実由、美奈は\nナイツレディース3人組。\nトリンドルさん演じる\nエリカの下っ端です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"挑戦してみたいメイク、髪型、\nお洋服とかってありますか？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モード系、ロリータ、ゴスロリ\n普段ではできないようなすごい服と\nすごい髪型とすごいメイクしたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お寿司で好きなネタ教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"炙りサーモンしか！！！！！\n**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は\nKANAZAWA GIRLS FESTIVAL2013\nに乃木坂46が出演します！\n私も出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもっきり楽しもう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/29/6816691/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"整った前髪。\n伊達眼鏡。\n鼻の穴が膨らみ。\nかわいいネクタイ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真、どうしても\n「今でしょ！」って言ってるように\nしか見えないんだがみなさんは\n何て言ってるように見えますか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}